class Shelf

// One hull model at one planet's shipyard: how many it has, how many it
// wants (its target, from the hull's class), and how many are on order.
// The market's count is the truth: it is pushed to the game's shipyard on
// landing (Game.set_ship_stock) and read back after, to see what the player
// bought or sold there. Saved in Market's "s|" records (target excepted).
// Change count and onorder only through Market (set_count, or touch after),
// which caches each planet's encoded record.

string planet = ""
string model = ""
// The model's row in the hull table.
int row = -1
int count = 0
int target = 0
int onorder = 0
